type: software
title: "Yourself To Science"
license-url: "https://yourselftoscience.org/license"
abstract: >-
  Website software and a directory of services through which individuals can
  contribute biological or digital data, samples, time or other resources to
  research. The archive contains separately licensed components: code under
  AGPL-3.0-or-later, authored content under CC-BY-SA-4.0 and the directory dataset
  under CC0-1.0. These licences apply to their respective components, not as
  alternative choices for the entire archive. See the included licence files.
